    "description": "**Retrieve A Transaction allows you to obtain the details and status of a transaction, whether it is successful or failed, using one of the following methods:**\n\n1. **Retrieve Transaction with Order ID or Merchant Order ID(Special Reference Number):** Use the Order ID or the Merchant Order IDto access transaction details.\n    \n2. **Retrieve Transaction details Transaction ID.** Access transaction details using the Transaction ID\n    \n\n**BASE URLs**\n\n| **Country** | **BASE_URL** |\n| --- | --- |\n| Egypt | [https://accept.paymob.com](https://accept.paymob.com) |\n| Saudi Arabia | [https://ksa.paymob.com](https://ksa.paymob.com) |\n| United Arab Emirates | [https://uae.paymob.com](https://uae.paymob.com) |\n| Oman | [https://oman.paymob.com](https://oman.paymob.com) |",
