        "description": "## 🔐 Generate Authentication Token\n\nGenerates a bearer token for API authentication.\n\n#### 📦 Request Body\n\n#### ✅ Required Parameter\n\n#### **`API Key`** • String\n\n``` json\n{\"api_key\": \"YOUR_API_KEY\"}\n\n ```\n\n**  \nUsage:** `Authorization: Bearer {token}`\n\n**Important Notes:**\n\n- Token expires after 60 minutes\n    \n- Save the token and use it as Bearer token in Authorization header for all subsequent requests\n    \n- Format: `Authorization: Bearer {your_token}`\n    \n\n### 🔑 Getting Your API Key\n\n1. Log in to your [Paymob Dashboard](https://accept.paymob.com)**.**\n    \n2. Navigate to **Settings → Account Info**\n    \n3. The API key is the same for **Test Mode** and **Live Mode.**\n    \n4. Click **View** next to API Key\n    \n5. Copy the key\n    \n\n<img src=\"https://content.pstmn.io/878c7c2b-eae3-49e3-b600-f441dd6b90c3/aW1hZ2UucG5n\" width=\"1434\" height=\"617\">"
