        "description": "## 🔍 Inquire About Transaction using Order ID\n\nRetrieve transaction details by querying with the Order ID or Merchant Order ID. The response will include only the most recent transaction associated with the order.\n\n## 🔐 Authorization\n\nYou need to enter the authentication token value in the token box, as shown in the image below.\n\n<img src=\"https://theneo-prod-public.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/d6342822-109d-40eb-89d9-f4e62e3aa3ce.jpg\">\n\n---\n\n#### ✅ Required Parameter\n\n#### **`order_id`** • String\n\nor **`merchant_order_id`** • **String**\n\nThe Order ID or Merchant Order ID associated with the transaction you want to inquire about.\n\nExample:\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"order_id\": \"690898\"\n  //\"merchant_order_id\" : \"Stu_1234\"\n}\n\n ```\n\n### **How to get the Order ID?**\n\nAnswer: You can obtain the Order ID from your dashboard or from the transaction response in a webhook. Please see the screenshots below for both methods.\n\n<u><b>Order ID From Dashboard:</b></u>\n\n<img src=\"https://theneo-prod-public.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/ec52ed91-58a0-41e3-b9da-e5b9e9916697.jpg\">\n\n<u><b>Transaction ID From Transaction Response in Webhook:</b></u>\n\n<img src=\"https://content.pstmn.io/24898bc4-78ef-41df-8522-3e627d63b1c5/aW1hZ2UucG5n\" width=\"1199\" height=\"427\">\n\n### **How to get the Merchant Order ID (**Special Reference Number) **?**\n\nAnswer: You can obtain the Special Reference Number or Merchant Order ID from your dashboard or from the transaction response in a webhook. Please see the screenshots below for both methods.\n\nYou will pass a unique special reference number in this request parameter of intention. Refer to a unique or special identifier or reference associated with a transaction or order. It can be used for tracking or categorizing specific types of transactions, and it returns within the transaction callback.\n\n<u><b>Merchant Order ID From Dashboard:</b></u>\n\n<img src=\"https://theneo-prod-public.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/79ad3b6c-5526-4f37-9f1a-95e33cd27ab5.jpg\">\n\n<u><b>Special Reference Number From Transaction Response in Webhook:</b></u>\n\n<img src=\"https://theneo-prod-public.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/ed9f156e-ef3b-4fe8-ad53-b432c61d6817.jpg\">\n\n## 📤 Response\n\n### Success • 200\n\nJSON\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"id\": 574588,\n  \"pending\": false,\n  \"amount_cents\": 2000,\n  \"success\": true,\n  \"is_auth\": false,\n  \"is_capture\": false,\n  \"is_standalone_payment\": true,\n  \"is_voided\": false,\n  \"is_refunded\": false,\n  \"is_3d_secure\": true,\n  \"integration_id\": 158,\n  \"profile_id\": 106,\n  \"has_parent_transaction\": false,\n  \"order\": {\n    \"id\": 690898,\n    \"created_at\": \"2024-10-02T16:31:23.273982+04:00\",\n    \"delivery_needed\": false,\n    \"merchant\": {\n      \"id\": 106,\n      \"created_at\": \"2023-04-14T03:30:26.562808+04:00\",\n      \"phones\": [\n        \"10523456789\"\n      ],\n      \"company_emails\": [\n        \"xxxxxxxxx.03@gmail.com\"\n      ],\n      \"company_name\": \"Retro\",\n      \"state\": \"\",\n      \"country\": \"xxxx\",\n      \"city\": \"temp\",\n      \"postal_code\": \"\",\n      \"street\": \"\"\n    },\n    \"collector\": null,\n    \"amount_cents\": 2000,\n    \"shipping_data\": {\n      \"id\": 488035,\n      \"first_name\": \"ala\",\n      \"last_name\": \"zain\",\n      \"street\": \"dumy\",\n      \"building\": \"dumy\",\n      \"floor\": \"dumy\",\n      \"apartment\": \"dumy\",\n      \"city\": \"dumy\",\n      \"state\": \"dumy\",\n      \"country\": \"dumy\",\n      \"email\": \"xxxxx@gmail.com\",\n      \"phone_number\": \"+92345xxxxxx\",\n      \"postal_code\": \"NA\",\n      \"extra_description\": \"\",\n      \"shipping_method\": \"UNK\",\n      \"order_id\": 690898,\n      \"order\": 690898\n    },\n    \"currency\": \"EGP\",\n    \"is_payment_locked\": false,\n    \"is_return\": false,\n    \"is_cancel\": false,\n    \"is_returned\": false,\n    \"is_canceled\": fa